  - Krieger was out sick with flu and high fever — doubly unusual
    since "neither one of us was ever out sick"
  - Practical implication: even elite traders can be caught flat-footed
    by geopolitical surprises; the discovery chain (NY no answer →
    London call → Krieger sick at home) illustrates operational
    vulnerability when key personnel are unavailable during a crisis

