    the value of money**; they don't get caught up in the excitement of
    the wager size
  - Those who ARE excited by the size of the bet (whether gambling or
    investing) are likely to be **destabilized by losses** — emotional
    reaction to drawdowns disqualifies them as traders
  - Practical implication: self-awareness about one's relationship to
    money and risk-excitement is a prerequisite screening test before
    trading

- [NICE TO KNOW][N006] **Why trade? — game element as intrinsic
